WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.373 --> 00:00:07.568
Hello, everyone! I'm Ms. Lily. Welcome to Online Class!

2
00:00:07.618 --> 00:00:09.493
Hi! I'm Malis!

3
00:00:09.543 --> 00:00:12.670
Unit one. Hello, Friends!

4
00:00:13.494 --> 00:00:18.814
Let's learn eight new words. Listen, then it's your turn to say it!

5
00:00:19.814 --> 00:00:21.464
Wink!

6
00:00:21.514 --> 00:00:26.520
Wink. Your turn!

7
00:00:26.570 --> 00:00:27.748
Wink!

8
00:00:27.798 --> 00:00:28.948
Great!

9
00:00:29.981 --> 00:00:32.014
High five!

10
00:00:32.064 --> 00:00:37.569
High five. Your turn!

11
00:00:37.619 --> 00:00:38.936
High five!

12
00:00:38.986 --> 00:00:40.136
Super!

13
00:00:41.148 --> 00:00:42.612
Hug!

14
00:00:42.662 --> 00:00:47.679
Hug. Your turn!

15
00:00:47.729 --> 00:00:48.919
Hug!

16
00:00:48.969 --> 00:00:50.389
Well done!

17
00:00:51.147 --> 00:00:52.727
Nod!

18
00:00:52.777 --> 00:00:57.643
Nod. Your turn!

19
00:00:57.693 --> 00:00:59.034
Nod!

20
00:00:59.084 --> 00:01:00.234
Yes!

21
00:01:01.213 --> 00:01:02.747
Bow!

22
00:01:02.797 --> 00:01:07.791
Bow. Your turn!

23
00:01:07.841 --> 00:01:09.020
Bow!

24
00:01:09.070 --> 00:01:10.510
Good job!

25
00:01:11.573 --> 00:01:13.698
Smile big!

26
00:01:13.748 --> 00:01:19.520
Smile big. Your turn!

27
00:01:19.570 --> 00:01:21.886
Smile big!

28
00:01:21.936 --> 00:01:23.652
Wonderful!

29
00:01:24.661 --> 00:01:26.693
Clap hands!

30
00:01:26.743 --> 00:01:32.004
Clap hands. Your turn!

31
00:01:32.054 --> 00:01:33.651
Clap hands!

32
00:01:33.701 --> 00:01:34.851
Nice!

33
00:01:35.923 --> 00:01:37.399
Buddy!

34
00:01:37.449 --> 00:01:42.246
Buddy. Your turn!

35
00:01:42.296 --> 00:01:43.218
Buddy!

36
00:01:43.268 --> 00:01:44.481
Excellent!

37
00:01:45.550 --> 00:01:53.244
Wink, Wink, Wink! High five, High five! Hug, Hug, Hug! Nod, Nod, Nod!

38
00:01:53.294 --> 00:02:01.650
Bow, Bow, Bow! Smile big, Smile big! Clap hands, Clap hands! Buddy, Buddy, Buddy!

39
00:02:01.700 --> 00:02:04.855
Clap, clap! Great chanting!

40
00:02:05.872 --> 00:02:14.440
Malis meets her buddy at the door. They give a high five and a big hug. Then they smile big and clap hands!

41
00:02:14.490 --> 00:02:17.171
I love this story, Ms. Lily!

42
00:02:17.956 --> 00:02:23.330
What is it? Can you say it?

43
00:02:23.380 --> 00:02:25.550
Hug! Well done!

44
00:02:26.890 --> 00:02:32.302
What is it? Can you say it?

45
00:02:32.352 --> 00:02:34.476
Bow! Well done!

46
00:02:35.711 --> 00:02:41.088
What is it? Can you say it?

47
00:02:41.138 --> 00:02:43.424
Wink! Well done!

48
00:02:44.811 --> 00:02:46.708
Let's say it together!

49
00:02:46.758 --> 00:02:51.934
Hi! I'm Malis. Hi! I'm Lily.

50
00:02:51.984 --> 00:02:56.501
Your turn!

51
00:02:56.551 --> 00:03:01.276
Hi! I'm Malis. Hi! I'm Lily.

52
00:03:02.977 --> 00:03:09.753
How do you say hello to your buddy?

53
00:03:09.803 --> 00:03:11.399
Hi! I'm Malis.

54
00:03:11.449 --> 00:03:12.915
Great answer!

55
00:03:13.765 --> 00:03:18.725
Today's value is friendliness. Smile and say hello to everyone.

56
00:03:18.775 --> 00:03:21.061
I will try, Ms. Lily!

57
00:03:22.253 --> 00:03:28.720
Great job today, everyone! See you in Unit two. Bye-bye!

58
00:03:28.770 --> 00:03:30.049
Bye-bye!

